{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>網絡流傳一段影片，直擊黃大仙沙田坳道一處山坡，有一名身穿長裙的女子無視安全，跨過路邊鐵欄，徒手爬上路邊大樹。片中可見女子高掛在離地數米高的樹上，期間更不斷將樹枝折斷，過程險象環生，一旦不慎失足後果不堪設想。長裙女在樹上攀爬折枝期間，現場有路人停下腳步圍觀。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-22-10h58m16s866.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026brQH5SLYju1792638274.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-22-10h58m29s887.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xv6iNaOR2L1792638267.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>影片隨即引爆網民熱烈討論，大部分人對其怪異行徑大惑不解，紛紛留言直呼：「呢位姑娘做緊乜呢」、「痴X線！」、「爬樹揾乜？採藥嗎？」。不少網民亦為其捏一把汗，指出「樹枝咁幼，佢再爬高少少，都未必頂得順」，更嚴肅警告「跌落嚟隨時冇命」，直指行為極度危險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.633139+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:58:33.902710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:57.851101+00:00","content_hash":"eec26015da701bf749056ba91cf7eb0e52cb6c18bacb0574ef722460197fa4cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}